    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d29">

                <pb facs="0054" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg42"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851R.01/75: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Algiers</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Wiley</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-01-16T20:00:00-04:00">January 16, 1943—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>92. For Murphy. Your 3575, December 30<anchor n="59" xml:id="d29-f1"/> and No.
                    46, January 12. In view of General Eisenhower’s and your recommendations the
                    Department agrees that French West Africa should be included under the civil
                    affairs jurisdiction of General Eisenhower’s Staff.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
